  "id": "68e3e04f01583c190519edc5",
  "images": [],
  "status": 200,
  "text": "<div><h3 data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"377\"><strong data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"381\">1.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"419\" data-start=\"388\">A developer creates a button:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"420\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button id=\"btn1\" onclick=\"updateAttr(this)\"&gt;Click Me&lt;/button&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>function updateAttr(el) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ el.setAttribute(\"data-status\", \"active\"); </code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(el.getAttribute(\"data-status\"));</code></p>\n\n<p><code>} </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"690\" data-start=\"642\">What is the output when the button is clicked?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"692\"><strong data-end=\"704\" data-start=\"692\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"707\" data-start=\"704\">\nA. active<br data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"716\">\nB. undefined<br data-end=\"734\" data-start=\"731\">\nC. Error<br data-end=\"745\" data-start=\"742\">\nD. Click Me</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"760\"><strong data-end=\"771\" data-start=\"760\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"772\">A</strong><br data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"777\">\n<strong data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"780\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"811\" data-start=\"797\">setAttribute</code> sets <code data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"817\">data-status</code>, and <code data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"836\">getAttribute</code> fetches it.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"864\">\n<h3 data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"869\"><strong data-end=\"879\" data-start=\"873\">2.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"880\">Consider this snippet:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"1171\" data-start=\"905\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;input type=\"text\" id=\"myInput\" value=\"Hello\"&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"changeValue()\"&gt;Change&lt;/button&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; function changeValue()</code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ let input = document.getElementById(\"myInput\");</code></p>\n\n<p><code>input.value = \"World\";</code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(input.value); } </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1223\" data-start=\"1172\">What appears on screen after clicking the button?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1225\"><strong data-end=\"1237\" data-start=\"1225\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"1240\" data-start=\"1237\">\nA. Hello<br data-end=\"1251\" data-start=\"1248\">\nB. World<br data-end=\"1262\" data-start=\"1259\">\nC. input element disappears<br data-end=\"1292\" data-start=\"1289\">\nD. undefined</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1308\"><strong data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1308\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1325\" data-start=\"1320\">B</strong><br data-end=\"1328\" data-start=\"1325\">\n<strong data-end=\"1344\" data-start=\"1328\">Explanation:</strong> The <code data-end=\"1356\" data-start=\"1349\">value</code> property is updated and printed.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1391\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1396\"><strong data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1400\">3.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1428\" data-start=\"1407\">A developer writes:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"1736\" data-start=\"1429\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"toggleAttr(this)\"&gt;Toggle&lt;/button&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>function toggleAttr(btn) { if(btn.hasAttribute(\"disabled\"))</code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ btn.removeAttribute(\"disabled\"); }</code></p>\n\n<p><code>else { btn.setAttribute(\"disabled\", \"true\"); }</code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(btn.hasAttribute(\"disabled\")); }</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1784\" data-start=\"1737\">What happens when the button is clicked once?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1847\" data-start=\"1786\"><strong data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1786\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"1801\" data-start=\"1798\">\nA. true<br data-end=\"1811\" data-start=\"1808\">\nB. false<br data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1819\">\nC. Error<br data-end=\"1833\" data-start=\"1830\">\nD. undefined</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1938\" data-start=\"1849\"><strong data-end=\"1860\" data-start=\"1849\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1866\" data-start=\"1861\">A</strong><br data-end=\"1869\" data-start=\"1866\">\n<strong data-end=\"1885\" data-start=\"1869\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"1900\" data-start=\"1886\">hasAttribute</code> returns true after <code data-end=\"1930\" data-start=\"1920\">disabled</code> is set.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1943\" data-start=\"1940\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1955\" data-start=\"1945\"><strong data-end=\"1955\" data-start=\"1949\">4.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"1956\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"modifyStyle(this)\"&gt;Click&lt;/button&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>function modifyStyle(el) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ el.style.backgroundColor = \"red\"; document.write(el.style.backgroundColor); }</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2198\" data-start=\"2153\">What will the page display after the click?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2269\" data-start=\"2200\"><strong data-end=\"2212\" data-start=\"2200\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"2215\" data-start=\"2212\">\nA. red<br data-end=\"2224\" data-start=\"2221\">\nB. undefined<br data-end=\"2239\" data-start=\"2236\">\nC. rgb(255, 0, 0)<br data-end=\"2259\" data-start=\"2256\">\nD. Error</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2369\" data-start=\"2271\"><strong data-end=\"2282\" data-start=\"2271\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2283\">A</strong><br data-end=\"2291\" data-start=\"2288\">\n<strong data-end=\"2307\" data-start=\"2291\">Explanation:</strong> Inline style <code data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2321\">backgroundColor</code> is set to \"red\" and retrieved.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"2374\" data-start=\"2371\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2386\" data-start=\"2376\"><strong data-end=\"2386\" data-start=\"2380\">5.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"2626\" data-start=\"2387\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;p id=\"para1\"&gt;Sample&lt;/p&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"addClass()\"&gt;Add Class&lt;/button&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>function addClass() </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ let p = document.getElementById(\"para1\"); </code></p>\n\n<p><code>p.className = \"highlight\";</code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(p.className); } </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2678\" data-start=\"2627\">What will be displayed after clicking the button?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2774\" data-start=\"2680\"><strong data-end=\"2692\" data-start=\"2680\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"2695\" data-start=\"2692\">\nA. Sample<br data-end=\"2707\" data-start=\"2704\">\nB. highlight<br data-end=\"2722\" data-start=\"2719\">\nC. undefined<br data-end=\"2737\" data-start=\"2734\">\nD. class highlight applied silently</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2776\"><strong data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2776\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2788\">B</strong><br data-end=\"2796\" data-start=\"2793\">\n<strong data-end=\"2812\" data-start=\"2796\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"2824\" data-start=\"2813\">className</code> property sets and returns the class.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"2866\" data-start=\"2863\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2878\" data-start=\"2868\"><strong data-end=\"2878\" data-start=\"2872\">6.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"2879\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"setData(this)\"&gt;Set&lt;/button&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>function setData(btn) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ btn.dataset.role = \"admin\"; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(btn.dataset.role);</code></p>\n\n<p><code>} </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3114\" data-start=\"3053\">What will be printed on the page after clicking the button?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3177\" data-start=\"3116\"><strong data-end=\"3128\" data-start=\"3116\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"3131\" data-start=\"3128\">\nA. admin<br data-end=\"3142\" data-start=\"3139\">\nB. role<br data-end=\"3152\" data-start=\"3149\">\nC. undefined<br data-end=\"3167\" data-start=\"3164\">\nD. Error</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3270\" data-start=\"3179\"><strong data-end=\"3190\" data-start=\"3179\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"3196\" data-start=\"3191\">A</strong><br data-end=\"3199\" data-start=\"3196\">\n<strong data-end=\"3215\" data-start=\"3199\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"3230\" data-start=\"3216\">dataset.role</code> sets a data attribute and retrieves it.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"3275\" data-start=\"3272\">\n<h3 data-end=\"3287\" data-start=\"3277\"><strong data-end=\"3287\" data-start=\"3281\">7.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"3469\" data-start=\"3288\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk1\" onclick=\"checkStatus(this)\"&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>function checkStatus(c) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ c.checked = !c.checked;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(c.checked); }</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3544\" data-start=\"3470\">If the checkbox was initially unchecked, what is printed on first click?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3607\" data-start=\"3546\"><strong data-end=\"3558\" data-start=\"3546\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"3561\" data-start=\"3558\">\nA. true<br data-end=\"3571\" data-start=\"3568\">\nB. false<br data-end=\"3582\" data-start=\"3579\">\nC. undefined<br data-end=\"3597\" data-start=\"3594\">\nD. Error</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3680\" data-start=\"3609\"><strong data-end=\"3620\" data-start=\"3609\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"3626\" data-start=\"3621\">A</strong><br data-end=\"3629\" data-start=\"3626\">\n<strong data-end=\"3645\" data-start=\"3629\">Explanation:</strong> The <code data-end=\"3659\" data-start=\"3650\">checked</code> property is toggled.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"3685\" data-start=\"3682\">\n<h3 data-end=\"3697\" data-start=\"3687\"><strong data-end=\"3697\" data-start=\"3691\">8.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"3901\" data-start=\"3698\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;img id=\"img1\" src=\"img1.jpg\" onclick=\"changeSrc(this)\"&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; function changeSrc(img) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ img.setAttribute(\"src\", \"img2.jpg\");</code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(img.getAttribute(\"src\")); </code></p>\n\n<p><code>} </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3948\" data-start=\"3902\">What will appear after the image is clicked?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4034\" data-start=\"3950\"><strong data-end=\"3962\" data-start=\"3950\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"3965\" data-start=\"3962\">\nA. img1.jpg<br data-end=\"3979\" data-start=\"3976\">\nB. img2.jpg<br data-end=\"3993\" data-start=\"3990\">\nC. Error<br data-end=\"4004\" data-start=\"4001\">\nD. [object HTMLImageElement]</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4143\" data-start=\"4036\"><strong data-end=\"4047\" data-start=\"4036\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"4053\" data-start=\"4048\">B</strong><br data-end=\"4056\" data-start=\"4053\">\n<strong data-end=\"4072\" data-start=\"4056\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"4087\" data-start=\"4073\">setAttribute</code> changes the <code data-end=\"4105\" data-start=\"4100\">src</code> attribute; <code data-end=\"4131\" data-start=\"4117\">getAttribute</code> returns it.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"4148\" data-start=\"4145\">\n<h3 data-end=\"4160\" data-start=\"4150\"><strong data-end=\"4160\" data-start=\"4154\">9.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"4345\" data-start=\"4161\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button id=\"btn2\" onclick=\"updateText(this)\"&gt;Press&lt;/button&gt; &lt;script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>function updateText(btn)</code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ btn.innerHTML = \"Done\"; </code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(btn.innerHTML); </code></p>\n\n<p><code>} </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4389\" data-start=\"4346\">What is displayed after the button click?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4456\" data-start=\"4391\"><strong data-end=\"4403\" data-start=\"4391\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"4406\" data-start=\"4403\">\nA. Press<br data-end=\"4417\" data-start=\"4414\">\nB. Done<br data-end=\"4427\" data-start=\"4424\">\nC. undefined<br data-end=\"4442\" data-start=\"4439\">\nD. innerHTML</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4541\" data-start=\"4458\"><strong data-end=\"4469\" data-start=\"4458\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"4475\" data-start=\"4470\">B</strong><br data-end=\"4478\" data-start=\"4475\">\n<strong data-end=\"4494\" data-start=\"4478\">Explanation:</strong> <code data-end=\"4506\" data-start=\"4495\">innerHTML</code> updates button text and prints it.</p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"4546\" data-start=\"4543\">\n<h3 data-end=\"4559\" data-start=\"4548\"><strong data-end=\"4559\" data-start=\"4552\">10.</strong></h3>\n\n<pre data-end=\"4796\" data-start=\"4560\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;button onclick=\"setMultiple(this)\"&gt;Click Me&lt;/button&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;script&gt; function setMultiple(b) </code></p>\n\n<p><code>{ b.setAttribute(\"type\", \"submit\");</code></p>\n\n<p><code>b.setAttribute(\"name\", \"myButton\"); </code></p>\n\n<p><code>document.write(b.getAttribute(\"name\"));</code></p>\n\n<p><code>} </code></p>\n\n<p><code>&lt;/script&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4843\" data-start=\"4797\">What is printed after the button is clicked?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"4911\" data-start=\"4845\"><strong data-end=\"4857\" data-start=\"4845\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"4860\" data-start=\"4857\">\nA. submit<br data-end=\"4872\" data-start=\"4869\">\nB. myButton<br data-end=\"4886\" data-start=\"4883\">\nC. undefined<br data-end=\"4901\" data-start=\"4898\">\nD. Error</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"5012\" data-start=\"4913\"><strong data-end=\"4924\" data-start=\"4913\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"4930\" data-start=\"4925\">B</strong><br data-end=\"4933\" data-start=\"4930\">\n<strong data-end=\"4949\" data-start=\"4933\">Explanation:</strong> The <code data-end=\"4960\" data-start=\"4954\">name</code> attribute is set and retrieved with <code data-end=\"5011\" data-start=\"4997\">getAttribute</code>.</p>\n</div>"
}